# Row I2.4: the room for both sides. The staff room's read and its two writes on Mateo's design round: the lead (Hugo)
# is not refused (a write with no revision is a 400, not a refusal); an interviewer with no seat gets not-found; the
# recruiter and the hiring manager get not-found at the read and at the writes (the interviews action gate, never
# 403); the tenant gate stops the guest, anon and a Work-only person (403).
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/room | recruiter hiringManager interviewer2 guest=403 guest:aikoCoding=403 anon=403 workOnly=403 | interviewer
POST /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/start | recruiter hiringManager interviewer2 guest=403 anon=403 workOnly=403 | interviewer | {}
POST /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/end | recruiter hiringManager interviewer2 guest=403 anon=403 workOnly=403 | interviewer | {}
# The candidate's room read (D1): not-found to staff and anon, and to the guest too until the lead lets them in (the
# walk's I2.4 steps read it after Admit and after the end).
GET /api/interview-invite/room | anon recruiter interviewer guest
